    "stem": "A mentally competent 76-year-old man is in the\nterminal stage of multiple myeloma. He is unable to\nmove and requires 24-hour nursing care. Increasing\ndoses of narcotics are needed to control severe pain. As\na result, when he is pain-free, respiratory function is\nimpaired and consciousness is clouded. The patient\nsays he cannot live with this degree of pain and asks to\nbe given a lethal injection of pain medication. Which of\nthe following is the most appropriate step regarding the\npain medication?",
